WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.995
CAUSE. Show a labelled fungus icon, not a worm.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.379
LOOK. A simple drawing of a possible round skin rash.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.995
PREVENT. Use personal towels and clean clothing.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.187
HELP. Tell a trusted adult and see a healthcare worker.
